 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> ここはゴミを宝に変える鍛冶屋。さまざまなスクラップを組み合わせて、この店にしかない様々な種類の装備を作り出せるよ。お店をアップグレードしながら新しいレシピを増やして、ドラゴン、おばあちゃん、ペンギン、ロボットなど奇妙なお客さんの注文に応えていこう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/57adf086effff232f3bd727c310079b7.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Scavenge the trash\" width=320 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ゴミの山から、新しい装備にぴったりなスクラップを見つけよう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Trash being collected from a trash can\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/0ef8476451cd110ca61880fd3db2421e.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Craft Wacky Weapons\" width=367 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >見つけた素材を使って、ポニーハンマーやクッキーの盾のようなユニークな装備を作ろう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"rhythm minigames being played\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/444122fb3d99689ea6050c4b3673b04c.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Serve unconventional customers\" width=461 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >芸術的な作品を、小犬やミイラ、モンスターなどに売ろう！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Short clips of different customers\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/e9896e865b6d0dde84109ba6c2907829.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Upgrade your store\" width=334 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >アライグマのディオゲネスから色んな小物を買って、お店をアップグレードしていこう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"The black hole upgrade is bought and then used to clean trash\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >このゲームの特徴：</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ゴミをあさってクラフト素材を見つける</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >素材を組み合わせておかしな装備を作る</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ミニゲームをプレイして完璧な作品を作り出す</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >個性あふれるお客さんたちに品物を売る</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >お店をアップグレードして、ガラクタ鍛冶屋の作業を自動化する</p></li></ul>",
